    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      80.16,
      548.53,
      114.23
    ],
    "text": "4. Any Foreign Contractor shall, upon payment of the applicable registration fee as specified in the Second Schedulehereto, be assigned with a registration number and issued with a Certificate of Temporary Registraton for each project whichshall be valid for a period as specified in such Certificate.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      128.16,
      548.55,
      162.23
    ],
    "text": "5. Every Foreign Contractor registered with the Authority shall at least Fourteen days prior to the date of expiry of suchregistration make an application to the Authority along with the renewal fee as specified in the Second Schedule hereto for therenewal of such Certificate.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      71.28,
      176.16,
      169.39,
      186.23
    ],
    "text": "6. In these regulations \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.28,
      196.56,
      548.29,
      206.63
    ],
    "text": "\"Identified Construction Work\" shall have the same meaning as in the Construction Industry Development Act, No.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      98.4,
      208.56,
      143.47,
      218.63
    ],
    "text": "33 of 2014;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      271.92,
      237.36,
      332.56,
      247.43
    ],
    "text": "FIRST SCHEDULE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.953384876251221,
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      163.2,
      261.41,
      441.54,
      271.48
    ],
    "text": "Procedure for Registration and renewal of Foreign Contractors",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      285.36,
      548.38,
      307.43
    ],
    "text": "1. Application forms (for registration/renewal of registration) may be obtained at the Authority. The duly completedapplication forms should be sent to the Director-General of the Authority along with the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      81.12,
      317.76,
      317.38,
      327.83
    ],
    "text": "(a) A letter from the client intending to award the contract;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      81.12,
      338.16,
      381.74,
      348.23
    ],
    "text": "(b) Certified Company Profile and the Financial Statement of the Company;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      81.84,
      358.56,
      256.5,
      368.63
    ],
    "text": "(c) Details of professionals and other staff;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      81.12,
      378.96,
      206.34,
      389.03
    ],
    "text": "(d) Detail of past performance;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      81.84,
      399.36,
      277.63,
      409.43
    ],
    "text": "(e) Details of imported plant and machinery; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      84.0,
      419.76,
      332.26,
      429.83
    ],
    "text": "(f) any other information as may be required by the Authority.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      443.76,
      548.42,
      465.83
    ],
    "text": "2. If the applicant fulfills all the requirements as may be necessary to obtain a registration, the applicant shall be informedof that within one week from the date of application.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      479.76,
      548.57,
      501.83
    ],
    "text": "3. The Certificate of registration shall be issued to the applicant upon payment of the relevant registration fee/renewal feeas specified in the Second Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.4,
      515.76,
      548.13,
      537.83
    ],
    "text": "4. The registration shall be renewed due to following reasons and such reasons shall be informed to the Authority priorto Fourteen days from the date of expiry of the Certificate:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      81.12,
      548.16,
      395.38,
      558.23
    ],
    "text": "(a) Change in scope of the project and subsequent increase of contract value;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      81.12,
      568.56,
      400.51,
      578.63
    ],
    "text": "(b) necessity to extend the time of the project in order to complete such project.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      266.64,
      597.36,
      337.84,
      607.43
    ],
    "text": "SECOND SCHEDULE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
